[zach@mic.UUCP (Zach Steele) writes:]
[] How do you train your pets? I am an amateur at nethack (I just started 
[] yesterday) and alot of things are unexplained. Like how do you open a
[] closed box with a key? What's the best character class? etc.

umm, the best character class depends on your style, however few will
argue that a priest/priestess is a definite win for novices given their
unique talent.  a lot of the other questions you'll have are nicely
answered in the nethack guidebook (which ought to be a fixture with
every installation!!!).  the guidebook is commonly available.

training your pet is a matter of rewarding good behavior. a good reward
is throwing a tripe ration at it (hopefully it will eat the food item).
good behavior for a pet is a matter of personal style, also (i.e. i like
a dog that will bring me my slippers and place them at my feet).

open a locked box by standing over it and applying a matching key (or
a universal device). the desired direction for applying the key would
naturally be down (">").

